# Loaded only by `npm run build` (mode=production), which is what the Dockerfile runs.
#
# Deliberately empty. The production bundle is served from the ASP.NET Core app's
# wwwroot, so an empty base makes every call same-origin and relative. Setting an
# absolute URL here would make the frontend cross-origin again and break the auth
# cookie in Firefox and Safari.
VITE_API_URL=
